{"book":8,"chapter":6,"rubric":"INSIDE THE KERNEL / CHAPTER 6","slides":[{"title":"The only door","sub":"Chapter 6 · System calls","short":"Intro","main":"Whatever a program can't do itself, it asks the kernel for with a system call.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Wall","Request","Work","Reply"],"captions":["A program can't read a disk or open a network itself","It asks the kernel through a system call, the only door","The kernel does the work on its own behalf, checking permissions","And returns the result: a number or an error code"],"frames":[[{"t":"zone","id":"u","x":74.0,"y":80.0,"w":128.0,"h":116.0,"tone":"outline","label":"program"},{"t":"zone","id":"k","x":286.0,"y":80.0,"w":128.0,"h":116.0,"tone":"outline","label":"kernel"},{"t":"cell","id":"c0","x":74.0,"y":38.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"open","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c1","x":74.0,"y":64.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"read","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c2","x":74.0,"y":90.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"fork","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c3","x":74.0,"y":116.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"mmap","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"gate","x":180.0,"y":80.0,"w":54.0,"h":30.0,"text":"syscall","tone":"muted","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"no","x":130.0,"y":150.0,"w":120.0,"h":18.0,"text":"disk directly: forbidden","tone":"red","size":8.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"zone","id":"u","x":74.0,"y":80.0,"w":128.0,"h":116.0,"tone":"outline","label":"program"},{"t":"zone","id":"k","x":286.0,"y":80.0,"w":128.0,"h":116.0,"tone":"outline","label":"kernel"},{"t":"cell","id":"c0","x":74.0,"y":38.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"open","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c1","x":74.0,"y":64.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"read","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c2","x":74.0,"y":90.0,"w":64.0,"h":20.0,"text":"fork","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cel